      "sizeBudgetKb": 14,
      "notes": "Guides: [mwg:css-layout] flexbox row, gap; [mwg:styling-web-components] host rules; forced-colors: the stack paints nothing, covered by the tct-stack forced-colors test. Size budget 14 kB (above the S default of 12): The direction wrappers ship the whole Stack class they extend (13.3 kB gzip measured)."
    }
  }
